June 4,2025
SUBJECT:
Right-of-Way License Agreement between Volunteers of America Northern
Rockies and the City of Cheyenne
Please find attached a Right-of-Way License Agreement between Volunteers of America
Northern Rockies and the Cityof Cheyennefor the connection of a storm sewer pipe from the
onsite detention pond to the storm sewer network in Seymour Avenue near East 25th Street.In
order to properly drain stormwater from the site, this outletpipe needsto extend into the public
right-of-way to connect to the existing network.
approvalof this agreement is respectfully requested.
